    "en": "A single-channel LoRa and GPS HAT (Semtech SX1276, 868/915 MHz class) for the Raspberry Pi 40-pin header. Used at 920-923 MHz it fits the Indonesian plan. Model only here.",
    "id": "HAT LoRa dan GPS satu kanal (Semtech SX1276, kelas 868/915 MHz) untuk header 40 pin Raspberry Pi. Dipakai di 920-923 MHz, cocok dengan rencana Indonesia. Hanya model di sini."
   },
